      "content": "The sensation you describe mirrors \"Existential Despair,\" where the abrupt realization of life's inherent meaninglessness leaves individuals feeling trapped in meaningless routines. Many find relief in \"absurdism,\" embracing this lack of inherent purpose to turn everyday tasks into personal rebellions against fate rather than solemn duties. Ultimately, whether you choose to continue or stop depends entirely on your ability to find fleeting definitions of purpose within the void.",
